<!-- wp:harlow/text {"element":"b29ff8c","classes":"elementor-element elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor hl-m-n21-0-0-0\u002d\u002dwc hl-p-0-0-0-0\u002d\u002dwc hl-c-ffffff hl-ff-roboto-sans-serif hl-fs-16 hl-fs-13\u002d\u002dm hl-fw-400 hl-lh-26 hl-ta-justify hl-ta-justify\u002d\u002dt","settings":"{\u0022_animation\u0022:\u0022fadeInUp\u0022}"} -->
<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The Al Khairat Thermal Power Plant will bring multiple benefits to Iraq and the Karbala region:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Enhanced Power Supply: Increases Iraq’s electricity generation capacity, reducing power shortages and supporting socio-economic growth.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Optimized Fuel Use: Maximizes the economic value of heavy fuel oil, a by-product of the Karbala Refinery.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Reduced Outages: Promotes industrial and commercial productivity, improving quality of life for Iraqi citizens.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Job Creation: Generates over 3,000 direct jobs during construction.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Local Economic Boost: Provides opportunities for local contractors and suppliers to support the plant’s development.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Through HIL, Al Khairat remains a strategic investment in Harlow Group’s portfolio, supporting Iraq’s energy security, economic resilience and community well-being.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->
